WEBVTT

01:55.040 --> 01:58.210
Oh, my precious darling,
your hands are so rough.

01:58.210 --> 02:00.576
I think hard-working, tough
girls are so cute.

02:02.848 --> 02:04.315
You finally awake?

02:05.450 --> 02:08.851
Gross, c'mon! I was having
such an awesome dream!

02:13.192 --> 02:14.682
The ocean!

02:16.295 --> 02:17.762
That's Coco Oco Island.

02:18.530 --> 02:22.591
That is where we'll find the legendary
Treasure of the Trembling Heart.

02:22.935 --> 02:24.937
Don't they have all kinds of girls
in bikinis on that island?

02:24.937 --> 02:26.605
Get your priorities straight!

02:26.605 --> 02:28.232
I guess we'll find out
when we get there.

02:28.473 --> 02:29.675
Hey, don't pretend like you...

02:29.675 --> 02:32.576
Hey! The train is going
to go underwater!

02:32.945 --> 02:37.644
The Musical Island of Coco Oco

02:48.393 --> 02:51.230
So, the train can only pass through
when the tide goes out?

02:51.230 --> 02:52.697
That's right.

02:54.866 --> 02:57.266
What's that? It sounds
like a xylophone?

02:59.037 --> 03:00.839
That's just the sound of the railroad.

03:00.839 --> 03:02.204
Isn't it nice?

03:10.749 --> 03:12.216
Now I hear a flute.

03:12.618 --> 03:14.152
That's just the trees.

03:14.152 --> 03:16.177
The leaves make that sound when
the wind blows through the trees.

03:29.534 --> 03:31.195
What kind of island is this anyway?

03:32.304 --> 03:35.171
Coco Oco is famous for
making instruments.

03:35.674 --> 03:37.175
They say anyone who
really loves music

03:37.175 --> 03:38.870
must visit here at least once
in their life.

03:41.413 --> 03:42.748
This is the best one you'll ever find.

03:42.748 --> 03:42.914
What's that one?
This is the best one you'll ever find.

03:42.914 --> 03:44.245
What's that one?

03:48.387 --> 03:51.584
Wow, that's so cool!

03:56.595 --> 03:58.797
So, what are we here to steal anyway?

03:58.797 --> 04:02.501
I wanted to come here and
just enjoy all of the music.

04:02.501 --> 04:05.137
What about the Treasure
of the Trembling Heart

04:05.137 --> 04:06.604
that you were talking
about earlier? Hey!

04:07.339 --> 04:09.637
Jing! There's no reason for you
to hide it from me!

04:10.008 --> 04:11.475
This is it.

04:12.511 --> 04:13.679
Isn't it cute?

04:13.679 --> 04:15.579
We didn't come all the way out here
to buy souvenirs!

04:17.182 --> 04:18.877
This is a real-life mockingbird.

04:19.985 --> 04:24.046
Shut up! I'm not a mockingbird.
I'm just pretending!

04:24.656 --> 04:26.214
Hey, why don't you give us
a little concert?

04:26.458 --> 04:30.028
No! I'm sick of this joke already!

04:30.028 --> 04:33.225
It would be a breach of contract for
me to play for you guys anyway!

04:39.738 --> 04:41.373
The sea!

04:41.373 --> 04:42.840
The deep, blue sky!

04:43.342 --> 04:44.809
The bright red sun!

04:46.178 --> 04:49.113
A beach full of bikini clad girls!

04:49.748 --> 04:52.484
I have a strong passion
burning inside me,

04:52.484 --> 04:54.384
and I just feel like falling in love!

04:57.022 --> 04:59.923
Hey! Where are all the cute girls
in bathing suits?

05:00.726 --> 05:03.024
I know they'll come!
They have to come!

05:03.395 --> 05:04.862
I know, once they check out
my hot body,

05:05.430 --> 05:07.728
the ladies are going to be all over me!

05:14.740 --> 05:17.300
Jing!

05:24.950 --> 05:26.417
Are you okay?

05:29.287 --> 05:32.222
Oh, my beautiful, bathing suit darling!
These are for you.

05:33.725 --> 05:36.261
Bathing suit? Have you
lost your memory?

05:36.261 --> 05:38.320
I found you washed up on the beach.

05:38.997 --> 05:40.766
You saved me?

05:40.766 --> 05:44.636
Yes, I'm glad you're doing okay. Well...

05:44.636 --> 05:46.104
The name's Kir.

05:46.104 --> 05:48.807
I'm Mimosa. Are you hungry?

05:48.807 --> 05:51.332
I'm in the middle of making some
soup. I'll go get you some.

05:52.778 --> 05:54.769
She seems pretty nice.

05:56.348 --> 05:59.146
I was really looking forward to
my duet with a bikini girl.

06:05.757 --> 06:07.247
Hey, are you all right?

06:08.293 --> 06:10.158
Sorry for all the noise.

06:11.696 --> 06:13.163
Your glasses are crooked.

06:15.634 --> 06:19.229
My late mother and father used to
always tell me the same thing.

06:19.738 --> 06:21.740
You live here all alone?

06:21.740 --> 06:24.004
Yes, so go ahead and make
yourself at home.

06:28.213 --> 06:30.015
Ouch!

06:30.015 --> 06:30.947
Oh, no, the soup! The soup!

06:35.387 --> 06:37.489
Oh, no! Not another broken plate!

06:37.489 --> 06:40.458
The soup is boiling down! I've got
to get the cabbage in there!

06:40.992 --> 06:41.159
Oh, no, I'm bleeding!

06:41.159 --> 06:42.961
She seems so careless.
Oh, no, I'm bleeding!

06:42.961 --> 06:45.395
Hey, come on, settle down!
I'll take it from here!

06:57.843 --> 06:59.572
Hey, set the table.

07:00.045 --> 07:01.746
Okay!

07:01.746 --> 07:03.348
Ouch!

07:03.348 --> 07:04.940
I told you to be careful!

07:08.220 --> 07:11.289
Wow, this looks amazing!
How did you do all this?

07:11.289 --> 07:14.087
I don't have a lady around, so
someone's got to do the cooking.

07:15.760 --> 07:16.461
It's good!

07:16.461 --> 07:17.762
Of course it is.

07:17.762 --> 07:18.964
I'm so happy.

07:18.964 --> 07:21.797
It's been so long since I've eaten
dinner with anyone.

07:22.167 --> 07:25.796
It's been a while for me too.

07:26.171 --> 07:27.832
I'm always with Jing.

07:30.809 --> 07:31.910
What's wrong, Kir?

07:31.910 --> 07:33.377
Oh, nothing, never mind.

07:33.612 --> 07:35.380
Hey, that's good even for me!

07:35.380 --> 07:36.414
Isn't it though?

07:36.414 --> 07:36.681
Hey, quit bragging!
Isn't it though?

07:36.681 --> 07:38.205
Hey, quit bragging!

07:43.021 --> 07:45.512
There really are no bathing
suit girls, are there?!

07:45.924 --> 07:49.895
All we do here is make instruments.
This isn't really a party town.

07:49.895 --> 07:51.630
But...

07:51.630 --> 07:53.765
What are you doing on this
island anyway, Kir?

07:53.765 --> 07:54.699
I came here for work.

07:54.699 --> 07:56.167
Are you a musician?

07:56.167 --> 07:59.830
I'm a singer. You could say that I have
quite an explosive voice.

08:00.238 --> 08:02.263
What about you? What work
do you do?

08:02.841 --> 08:04.308
Me?

08:07.279 --> 08:08.880
You make castanets?

08:08.880 --> 08:10.973
Yep, I'm still just an apprentice though.

08:11.349 --> 08:12.816
But you know...

08:23.094 --> 08:24.129
Sorry about that.

08:24.129 --> 08:25.756
No problem...

08:27.432 --> 08:31.300
Hey, I made those castanets.
Did you buy them?

08:32.304 --> 08:33.705
Thank you!

08:33.705 --> 08:35.900
Hey, you, how's the job
coming along?!

08:36.441 --> 08:38.636
You're not doing anything, are you?
Quit wasting time!

08:39.878 --> 08:41.345
Go on, get out of here!

08:44.516 --> 08:47.417
Is he a friend of yours? He must be
a great musician.

08:47.852 --> 08:52.023
He's the Bandit King, but without me
he's just a petty thief.

08:52.023 --> 08:54.993
The Bandit King that can steal
the very stars from the sky?

08:54.993 --> 08:56.984
That's him? No way!

08:57.696 --> 08:59.163
Is he a good friend of yours?

08:59.965 --> 09:01.499
I'm serious.

09:01.499 --> 09:03.626
I can tell that you guys are friends
by how passionately you fight!

09:04.736 --> 09:06.972
I want to see you fight with all of
your friends. Call him over!

09:06.972 --> 09:08.735
Stop it, I can't stand this!

09:18.316 --> 09:19.783
A pond?

09:23.388 --> 09:25.117
Idiot! I never!

09:47.646 --> 09:51.343
All that's left is to fry the fish.
Mimosa should be home any minute.

09:53.585 --> 09:55.644
I'll show her what a bird can do!

10:01.026 --> 10:04.518
She's late. I wonder if she was
in an accident or something?

10:06.898 --> 10:08.422
What? A flute?

10:09.300 --> 10:11.393
What's Jing doing with a flute now?

10:27.419 --> 10:29.087
Mimosa!

10:29.087 --> 10:30.155
Kir!

10:30.155 --> 10:31.723
What are you doing all
the way over here?

10:31.723 --> 10:32.957
Oh, nothing.

10:32.957 --> 10:33.792
Who's that?

10:33.792 --> 10:34.459
Don't worry about it. Let's go eat.
Who's that?

10:34.459 --> 10:35.357
Don't worry about it. Let's go eat.

10:37.028 --> 10:38.296
Ouch!

10:38.296 --> 10:39.931
You okay?

10:39.931 --> 10:41.398
What are you doing over there?

10:43.168 --> 10:44.635
Russian...

10:45.036 --> 10:47.732
Still haven't gotten rid of your
clumsiness, have you?

10:48.339 --> 10:49.874
Mind your own business!

10:49.874 --> 10:53.344
It sounds like someone needs to
go back to flute school to me!

10:53.344 --> 10:57.282
Well, at least I don't spend all day
trying to make castanets!

10:57.282 --> 10:58.416
I can make them just fine!

10:58.416 --> 11:00.452
They're a lot better than
that crappy flute!

11:00.452 --> 11:02.187
At least, I can play!

11:02.187 --> 11:03.388
You're just a hack of a musician!

11:03.388 --> 11:04.622
Look who's talking,
Ms. Crooked Glasses!

11:04.622 --> 11:06.291
Jackass!

11:06.291 --> 11:07.258
Pig-face!

11:07.258 --> 11:07.792
Turtle breath!
Pig-face!

11:07.792 --> 11:08.759
Turtle breath!

11:09.227 --> 11:10.694
You guys are saying exactly
what I'm thinking.

11:11.663 --> 11:13.264
Don't you guys ever run
out of breath?!

11:13.264 --> 11:14.754
What are you...

11:17.368 --> 11:18.835
Let's go, Kir!

11:22.340 --> 11:23.408
What is it?

11:23.408 --> 11:25.535
I can tell you guys are friends by
how passionately you fight!

11:35.487 --> 11:36.321
Salt...

11:36.321 --> 11:39.222
No, really, Russian and I
really aren't that close.

11:40.024 --> 11:41.192
Black pepper...

11:41.192 --> 11:42.819
It's just that he acts like such a kid.

11:43.695 --> 11:45.430
Just a few more spices...

11:45.430 --> 11:47.091
I mean...

11:47.465 --> 11:49.763
You wish he'd just grow up?

11:51.870 --> 11:56.534
Hey, trust me! I'm a long-time veteran
when it comes to love.

12:02.180 --> 12:03.848
Okay, calm down. You ready?

12:03.848 --> 12:06.551
Nice and easy, just invite him
over for dinner.

12:06.551 --> 12:08.586
No man can resist homemade food.

12:08.586 --> 12:11.422
But you know I can't cook
to save my life.

12:11.422 --> 12:13.049
I'm going to do it for you!

12:16.261 --> 12:17.819
What do you think you're doing?!

12:18.263 --> 12:21.960
Oh, nothing, I wasn't waiting
for you or anything.

12:22.333 --> 12:25.069
Waiting for me? Do you want
to continue our fight?

12:25.069 --> 12:26.137
That's right!

12:26.137 --> 12:29.674
I never wanted you to come over
and eat my homemade cooking!

12:29.674 --> 12:31.869
Well, I'm glad you didn't ask,
because I'd never come!

12:35.947 --> 12:37.414
Denied...

12:41.586 --> 12:43.076
Do I look weird?

12:44.289 --> 12:47.258
I think you look a little
better this way.

12:47.258 --> 12:48.927
Really?

12:48.927 --> 12:50.417
All right, let's go.

12:51.296 --> 12:53.131
Man! How could a cool cat like myself

12:53.131 --> 12:54.894
lose his composure over
a girl like that?

13:07.145 --> 13:09.204
You can't really see, can you?

13:21.826 --> 13:23.628
Operation Homemade Cooking
has failed.

13:23.628 --> 13:26.564
Operation Find Bikini Girls
has failed.

13:26.564 --> 13:29.499
I'm sorry, you've been
helping me so much.

13:29.767 --> 13:31.536
You're going to have to be
honest with your feelings

13:31.536 --> 13:33.026
before we even think of coming up
with more operations.

13:37.775 --> 13:39.242
Him again.

13:42.080 --> 13:43.707
Why don't you try to calm
down yourself, Kir?

13:44.082 --> 13:46.880
You want to get along with him
better, don't you?

13:47.785 --> 13:51.923
I'm not joking around! I won't
lower myself to his level!

13:51.923 --> 13:53.720
I'm the one who's being mature here!

13:54.626 --> 13:56.093
I guess so.

14:01.132 --> 14:04.795
It's hard sometimes to calm my heart.

14:09.974 --> 14:12.101
I guess I'll never hear the
Ocarina of the Moon,

14:12.543 --> 14:14.779
and it will just never work out
between Russian and I.

14:14.779 --> 14:16.246
The Ocarina of the Moon?

14:16.781 --> 14:21.912
Yea, that ocarina flute is said to
make couple's hearts tremble.

14:22.453 --> 14:24.289
We have a legend here that any couple
who hears the music of that flute

14:24.289 --> 14:25.779
will stay in love forever
and never separate.

14:26.357 --> 14:30.628
Hearts tremble? I see, so the
Ocarina of the Moon

14:30.628 --> 14:32.687
must be the hidden treasure
he was talking about.

14:33.998 --> 14:35.465
Isn't it cool?

14:44.642 --> 14:46.344
Kir?

14:46.344 --> 14:47.779
What's wrong?

14:47.779 --> 14:50.646
Oh, nothing. Hey, can you tell me
where they keep that flute?

14:51.082 --> 14:53.318
Oh, nobody really knows.

14:53.318 --> 14:55.377
I've never heard of anyone
actually seeing it.

14:55.787 --> 14:58.756
But that's why everyone moved to
this island in the first place,

14:59.157 --> 15:01.421
with the hope of someday hearing
the great ocarina.

15:05.330 --> 15:06.797
Postino!

15:08.232 --> 15:09.467
Hey, Kir.

15:09.467 --> 15:12.402
Can you deliver a message to
my wayward partner for me?

15:13.438 --> 15:14.539
Oh, you guys.

15:14.539 --> 15:16.207
Are you fighting again?

15:16.207 --> 15:17.674
It's all his fault!

15:20.044 --> 15:22.103
Welcome back. There's
a letter here for you.

15:22.547 --> 15:24.014
Here you go.

15:28.453 --> 15:32.082
"The treasure is just a legend." -Kir

15:39.931 --> 15:42.525
Okay, I'm going to go on home first
and cook dinner.

15:43.701 --> 15:44.602
What is it?

15:44.602 --> 15:47.264
Wouldn't it be nice if I
fell in love with you?

15:48.773 --> 15:51.542
I feel so calm and relaxed
whenever I'm with you.

15:51.542 --> 15:55.603
Ever since you got here, it's like all
my sad thoughts just went away.

15:58.282 --> 16:00.147
I wish we could always be together.

16:02.587 --> 16:04.578
See, the ladies really
just can't resist me.

16:10.828 --> 16:12.263
Maybe she's right.

16:12.263 --> 16:14.493
It sure would be nice to settle down
like this for a change.

16:22.440 --> 16:24.931
It's getting bad out there.
I'd better go pick up Mimosa.

16:26.144 --> 16:26.844
Kir!

16:26.844 --> 16:27.645
Oh, welcome back!
Kir!

16:27.645 --> 16:28.479
Oh, welcome back!

16:28.479 --> 16:30.003
Kir, it's Russian!

16:37.288 --> 16:40.280
He's inside! He was practicing
his flute earlier today, and...

16:41.426 --> 16:42.893
What should we do, Kir?!

16:43.694 --> 16:45.161
Mimosa...

16:57.141 --> 17:00.599
You idiot! I almost decapitated
myself on that window!

17:06.217 --> 17:08.651
Will you please come with me?

17:09.187 --> 17:10.654
Please!

17:13.658 --> 17:15.125
Jing!

17:18.362 --> 17:19.886
Make way!

17:21.299 --> 17:22.766
Get out of the way!

17:23.401 --> 17:24.869
Kir!

17:24.869 --> 17:27.133
Now, you'll finally get a taste
of my amazing voice!

17:34.112 --> 17:35.943
Kir Royale!

17:45.690 --> 17:46.524
Are you okay?

17:46.524 --> 17:47.191
He's going to make it!
Are you okay?

17:47.191 --> 17:47.987
He's going to make it!

17:49.527 --> 17:50.994
Go to him.

17:51.662 --> 17:53.129
You love him, don't you?

17:53.898 --> 17:55.559
Now's the time to show him.

17:59.470 --> 18:00.994
Russian!

18:02.440 --> 18:05.170
Oh, I'm so glad you're okay!
Thank God!

18:08.846 --> 18:10.336
Russian?

18:11.415 --> 18:14.851
Thanks, I'm sorry to have worried you.

18:15.720 --> 18:17.187
But I'm happy you care.

18:25.463 --> 18:26.731
Are you crying?

18:26.731 --> 18:28.198
Who are you talking to?!

18:52.757 --> 18:54.892
It goes even deeper?

18:54.892 --> 18:57.383
Something tells me we're about to
hear something extraordinary.

18:59.030 --> 19:00.497
Hey, Jing!

19:09.473 --> 19:12.243
This has turned into a huge cave
now that all the water is gone.

19:12.243 --> 19:13.904
Hey, how deep are you going to go?

19:14.812 --> 19:17.007
I wonder if this is where they got
the name for the island?

19:19.083 --> 19:22.780
Coco Oco means empty coconut
in their native tongue.

20:15.406 --> 20:17.465
This is the Ocarina of the Moon.

20:17.775 --> 20:19.675
So, it is really is more than a legend.

20:20.144 --> 20:21.445
It would appear so.

20:21.445 --> 20:24.573
Without me, you never would
have found this treasure.

20:25.016 --> 20:28.213
But this is one thing that
we can not steal.

20:47.238 --> 20:50.469
These notes will keep these
two lovers together forever.

20:51.242 --> 20:54.575
I want to be with you
forever too, Jing.

20:55.579 --> 20:57.046
Me too.

21:04.722 --> 21:07.486
Kir! Kir!

21:16.400 --> 21:18.698
You never really even met the guy.
Are you sure you're ready to leave?

21:19.804 --> 21:21.271
Don't worry.
